:name: UART passthrough demo
:Nucleo H753ZI running the Zephyr uart_passthrough sample, what you type into usart3 comes out of usart2.

$bin?=$ORIGIN/uart_passthrough.elf

mach create "nucleo"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/nucleo_h753zi.repl
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart3
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart2
sysbus LoadELF $bin
